RISK MANAGEMENT CONSULTANT
Preparing marketing reports to assist in the placement of client insurance programs. Reports will follow the Willis Towers Watson standard structure and contain key understanding of hazards at facilities and how the management team are controlling/ mitigating their impact.
Present risk improvements and loss calculations
Develop risk improvement recommendations that are clear, appropriate and are fairly balanced between the interests of clients and insurers;
Calculate loss expectancies within company guidelines across a range of industries;
Undertake risk management audits;
Provide general advice on improving the risk management maturity within clients;
