Must have a minimum of 2 years’ experience as a qualified Millwright;
In depth mechanical and electrical knowledge of Winders, shafts, compressors, conveyors, screens, crushers, hydraulic systems and pumps is essential;
Ability to read and interpret electrical schematic drawings is essential;
Knowledge of Soft starters, Control and Instrumentation and SAP is advantageous.
Qualifications for this role are:
